file src/index/mod.rs
symbol File
lines 0 10
hash 92eab16d510ca422
note One text file. Lines are tab-expanded on load (a tab becomes four spaces) so display, hashing and column arithmetic all agree. mtime is what the GUI's watcher thread compares against the disk, hash, the FNV-1a of the tab-expanded text, keys the cache entry, backend says which resolver produced the symbols, and pending says a server exists for this language and has not answered for this text yet. path is relative to the root with forward slashes, hl holds each line's spans sorted and non-overlapping, and imports maps an imported name or alias to the module stem it comes from.

